    <h1>HabitBank Privacy Policy / 隱私權政策</h1>
    <p>Last Updated: July 2026 / 最近更新：2026年7月</p>

    <h2>1. Data Collection (資料收集)</h2>
    <p><b>EN:</b> HabitBank operates locally on your device. We do not collect or store any personally identifiable information (PII).<br>
    <b>中：</b>本程式於本機端執行。我們不會收集或儲存任何個人識別資料。</p>

    <h2>2. Camera Access (相機存取)</h2>
    <p><b>EN:</b> Camera access is used solely for taking photo/video evidence for deposit/charge records. Images are NOT uploaded to any server.<br>
    <b>中：</b>相機僅用於為存款/提款紀錄拍攝照片或錄影存證。影像不會上傳至任何伺服器。</p>
   
    <h2>3. Data Security (資料安全)</h2>
    <p><b>EN:</b> Since we do not store your data, there is no risk of a data breach from our side.<br>
    <b>中：</b>由於我們不儲存您的資料，因此不存在資料外洩風險。</p>

    <h2>4. Contact Us (聯絡我們)</h2>
    <p><b>EN:</b> If you have any questions, please contact BRAI Labs through our official channels.<br>
    <b>中：</b>若有任何疑問，請透過 BRAI Labs 官方管道聯絡。</p>
